      "q": "How much federal contract money goes to Iowa?",
      "a": "Total federal contract obligations in Iowa are $1.2B. That amount is a partial fiscal-year total for FY2026 to date. By comparison, obligations were $3.6B in FY25, $3B in FY24, $3.4B in FY23, $2.7B in FY22, and $2.5B in FY21."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies award the most contracts in Iowa?",
